Vehicle renders
---------------
Files: app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/car_cabin.webp, car_side.webp,
docs/hero_front.jpg, docs/hero_rear.jpg

Made from images supplied by the project owner (04_참고자료/01_차량이미지), which were produced
with an image generation model. They show a generic vehicle and no real make or model. The app
copies were cropped, resized and, for the two top-down views, cut out of their background.

Additional design-session files (2026-11-15):
app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/car_top_hd.webp, car_hero.webp, car_base.webp,
car_seat.webp, car_wheel.webp; docs/design/img/car_top.webp, car_top_hd.webp,
car_hero.jpg; docs/design/parts/car_base.png, car_seat.png, car_wheel.png

These use the same project-owner-supplied generated images. The design session cropped the
vehicle views and separated the body, driver's seat and steering wheel for animation.
See docs/design/web_readme.md ("자료 출처") and docs/design/spec.md, section 7.

Gleo AI logo
-------------
Files: app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/gleo.webp, docs/design/img/gleo.png

The project owner confirmed the Gleo AI logo as official Hyundai Motor Group material.
The design-session source image, recorded in docs/design/web_readme.md ("자료 출처"), is:
https://image.edaily.co.kr/images/photo/files/NP/S/2026/10/PS26103000698.jpg
The background was removed from the 520 x 520 source image to make gleo.png; the app copy
uses WebP. Source and processing notes are also in docs/design/spec.md, section 7.

Demo meeting audio
------------------
Files: app/src/main/assets/meeting/delivery/note_01.pcm to note_11.pcm,
app/src/main/assets/meeting/expansion/note_01.pcm to note_11.pcm

The demo meeting sentences (res/values/strings.xml, demo_note_texts and demo2_note_texts) read by the Windows
built-in voice "Microsoft Heami Desktop" on 2026-11-13, with the pitch varied per speaker, and
converted to 16 kHz, 16-bit mono PCM with FFmpeg. The terms for redistributing this voice's
output in an app have not been confirmed; replace the clips with recordings of the team's own
voices before the app is published.

